# Frontend environment variables (see frontend/README.md).
#
# Base URL used by the SPA for Laravel API calls (`docs/API_SPEC.md` §1).
# Keep it relative: the Vite dev server (docker/nginx also in production)
# reverse-proxies /api to the Laravel edge, so requests stay same-origin and no
# CORS configuration is required.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
